*.crx

# Real Steam page dumps contain the account's webapi_token, session ID, login
# name and other users' names and SteamIDs. Raw dumps stay local; only the
# output of tools/sanitize-fixtures.js (fixtures/clean/) is committed.
# Anything else dropped into fixtures/ is ignored by default.
fixtures/*
!fixtures/README.md
!fixtures/clean/

# Local scratch
*.log
.env
